        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Part 1-Preliminary ",
            "block_bbox": [
                162,
                355,
                511,
                384
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Division 1-Preliminary ",
            "block_bbox": [
                162,
                419,
                524,
                445
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "1 Short title.",
            "block_bbox": [
                162,
                483,
                321,
                506
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "This Act may be cited as the Superannuation Industry (Supervision) Act 1993.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                297,
                530,
                898,
                583
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "2 Commencement ",
            "block_bbox": [
                161,
                623,
                399,
                646
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) Subject to this section, Parts 1, 2, 21, 27, 28, 29, 30, 31 and 32commence on the day on which this Act receives the Royal Assent.",
            "block_bbox": [
                253,
                671,
                1044,
                724
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) Part 1 (in so far as it relates to section 117) and section 117 are taken to have commenced on 21 October 1992.",
            "block_bbox": [
                253,
                749,
                998,
                800
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) Parts 18, 19, 20, 23 and 24 and section 342 commence on 1 July 1994.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                252,
                825,
                1010,
                877
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(4) The remaining provisions commence on 1 December 1993, but do not apply to a fund, scheme or trust in relation to a year of income of the fund, scheme or trust earlier than the 1994-95 year of income.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                254,
                900,
                1028,
                1009
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "3 Object of Act ",
            "block_bbox": [
                164,
                1051,
                364,
                1078
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Supervision of certain superannuation entities ",
            "block_bbox": [
                301,
                1105,
                806,
                1130
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 12
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) The main object of this Act is to make provision for the prudent management of certain superannuation funds, approved deposit funds and pooled superannuation trusts and for their supervision by APRA, ASIC and the Commissioner of Taxation.",
            "block_bbox": [
                257,
                1151,
                1027,
                1254
            ],
            "block_id": 14,
            "block_order": 13
        },
        {
            "block_label": "footer",
            "block_content": "Superannuation Industry (Supervision) Act 1993",
